 <p><a name="footnote2"></a><sup>2</sup> Figures from UN World Investment  Report, IMF World Economic Outlook Database, World Bank World Development  Indicators.  </p>
 <p><a name="footnote3"></a><sup>3</sup> IMF World Economic Outlook,  April 2017, in market exchange rate terms.  </p>
<p><a name="footnote4"></a><sup>4</sup> Figures from Office of the U.S. Trade  Representative, UN World Investment Report.  </p>
<p><a name="footnote5"></a><sup>5</sup> Hufbauer and  Lowry, &ldquo;US Tire  Tariffs: Saving Few Jobs at High Cost&rdquo;, Peterson Institute for International  Economics, April 2012.  </p>    </div>
         

